  unitName: Warrior Eze
  unitId: 40011
  unitNumber: 13
  description: A warrior from the ruined Atharva Republic, he later became one of
    the Six Heroes. Raised in an old mine, he worked from the time he was a child.
    At one point he grew tired and left to become a demon bounty hunter. His swordsmanship
    was tempered through his mine work, and he could obliterate a normal demon in
    one blow. He spoke rough, but was polite to women.
  summonDesc: Hey! Get out of my way!<br>Friend or foe, no one stands<br>in front
    of me!
  fusionDesc: Wow!<br>Can you feel that<br>energy flowing!?
